    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00594a6debbebcb7",
      "translationZh": "IQ1_M 是一个刻意采用混合精度设计的产物：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce20aa426abc9fb5",
      "translationZh": "353 F32 + 1 IQ1_M + 2 IQ2_S + 64 Q4_K + 429 Q5_K + 2 Q6_K = 851 个张量",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e89cac327369f5ce",
      "translationZh": "从 IQ2_S 到 IQ1_M 的转变仅改变了一个选定的张量：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb2ae3e0a1e324be",
      "translationZh": "块 1 的前馈网络下投影权重: IQ2_S → IQ1_M",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c30a81ecbf156c76",
      "translationZh": "其余受保护的精度策略保持不变。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bae46b997f8c712",
      "translationZh": "这使得 IQ1_M 仅比 IQ2_S 小 8.633 MiB，因此我们并不将这种增量差异视为某种戏剧性的压缩突破。对我们来说更有趣的是，较低占用量的点仍然保持在冻结的质量包络线之内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
