    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f66da380a8fd3e3",
      "translationZh": "所有量化层级都使用以下方式针对相同的冻结 BF16 参考值进行了评估：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5678659620f0526f",
      "translationZh": "批处理 / 微批处理：512 / 512",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0760006badf442cf",
      "translationZh": "相同的 BF16 logits 在各层级之间重复使用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf57fdcc03be50c8",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp 版本：`42916d83f4a225e56709f873aa8050ac11f5b6a4`",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5b59ba14e806b84",
      "translationZh": "我们同时跟踪 PPL、KLD、Same top-p、RMS 概率漂移以及 log-PPL 相关性，而不是仅根据文件大小来选择量化层级。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f960037f33b8c35a",
      "translationZh": "此外，+0.3191% PPL 漂移并不是指 +0.3191% 下游基准损失。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65d5f80ecae33d7e",
      "translationZh": "我们没有为每个 GGUF 层级独立重新运行完整的九基准父模型活动，因此我们不会将 PPL 漂移转化为 SWE-bench、Terminal-Bench、AIME、GPQA 或其他任务得分下降。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8eceeae43fe8b17",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp + MTP 验证",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae3332ee69d1fbe6",
      "translationZh": "IQ1_M 也通过标准的 llama.cpp 运行路径进行了验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "23f4d8a29e15fc4b",
      "translationZh": "非空生成：PASS",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b300e9afcb494b18",
      "translationZh": "生成的草稿 token 数：104",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ae5deb692e0c30b",
      "translationZh": "接受的草稿 token 数：76",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6f13a0db8bf3f7f",
      "translationZh": "该次验证运行中的草稿接受率：73.0769%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b32c207e09644ca6",
      "translationZh": "对于该次固定的验证运行，最终仅包含 main 的输出与 main+MTP 输出的 SHA256 值是相同的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ae5bdaed4911d0f",
      "translationZh": "我们对 MTP 接受率进行描述性报告——它取决于提示词/工作负载，并不代表通用的 73% 吞吐量提升。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1fcb7622e7b73b2f",
      "translationZh": "我应该使用哪种 GGUF？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21560c863eb5f5dd",
      "translationZh": "如果你主要关注质量，同时又希望获得显著的内存减少，请从 Q6_K 开始。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18ca642dbdb75e12",
      "translationZh": "如果你想将内存控制在 ~19 GiB 以下，又不想直接推向极低占用率的极限，Q5_K_M 是折中选择。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bfb9f71adf5c3f0",
      "translationZh": "如果占用空间是首要考虑因素，IQ1_M 是最小的版本，大小为 16.790 GiB。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8659daa6a9248719",
      "translationZh": "如果你更倾向于在基本相同的占用空间下获得略低的平均 KLD，IQ2_S 是相邻的可选方案。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1621ebe8b86f2dc",
      "translationZh": "当保真度比内存更重要时，BF16/Q8_0 仍然可用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "85f161be54b133df",
      "translationZh": "科学推理演示",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3775442633ac599",
      "translationZh": "E2 版本还包括一个围绕黎曼 ζ 函数的科学推理演示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51de910c02ead038",
      "translationZh": "发布的产物在所述框架下，为临界线零点比例提供了一个可复现的 67.350003708785593% 严格有限维计算机辅助证明。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4819a05f2cc72aee",
      "translationZh": "这并不是黎曼猜想的证明，我们也没有将其作为端到端的 Lean/内核验证定理来呈现。推导、计算和验证产物均已公开，供独立审查。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1d139d3e6a566405",
      "translationZh": "可复现性 / 链接",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4395014cb5a2e895",
      "translationZh": "如果有人在不同的 GPU/CPU 上运行 GGUF 文件，特别是 Q6_K、Q5_K_M、IQ2_S 或 IQ1_M，那么提供具有可比性的 llama-bench pp/tg 数值、峰值内存占用、困惑度检查或下游任务结果将会非常有帮助。负面结果和错误报告也同样有用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11666bb30f50f01b",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/PleaseLee 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
